  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/2ffdb853e2d594c027.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"איור סמלי של עיפרון המונח על תשבץ\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"286\" data-original-width=\"287\" src=\"/assets/images/content/2ffdb853e2d594c027.png\" /></a></div><div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">התאמה מושלמת</span></h2></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">התאימו בין 2 חלקי הביטויים המופיעים בפרשה:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מכנסי.......המזבח</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אש...........בד</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חקת.........אזן</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קדש.........קדשים</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תורה........ימים</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לאהרן......למחנה</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קרנות......כן</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תנוך.......אחת</span></div><div><span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מחוץ......תמיד</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כי..........עולם</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שבעת...ולבניו</span></div></span></div></div><div><div><span><span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></span></h2><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מה זה&nbsp;מֻרְבֶּכֶת?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חלוטה במים רותחים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מורכבת להבנה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בלולה בשמן זית</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מנופה בכברה</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>מה זה&nbsp;</span>כָּלִיל?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יללת כאב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לילה כהה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בקלות</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הכל</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>מה זה&nbsp;</span>אַלְיָה?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זנב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כינוי לאליהו הנביא</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">דברי שבח והלל לה'</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ניצב מולה</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>מה זה&nbsp;</span>וַיַּז?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זרח</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">התיז</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תכנת ניווט ישראלית</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זרה ברוח</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>מה זה&nbsp;</span>רָקִיק?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ירקרק</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תוצר שמן קיק</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יריקה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מאפה דק</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>מה זה&nbsp;</span>פִּגּוּל?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פג תוקף</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עיגול</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מאוס</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מגולף</span></li></ol></ol></div></span></span></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><h3><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\"><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 אבל/רק<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 יחידת מידה למהירות<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 מזון<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 עבודה (מהפרשה)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 שַׁלִּיטָה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 שם אדם מספר בראשית<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 אביון</span></span></div></h3><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></span></h2><h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>התאמה מושלמת</span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span>מכנסי בד, אש תמיד, חקת עולם, קדש קדשים, תורה אחת, לאהרן ולבניו, קרנות המזבח, תנוך אזן, מחוץ למחנה, כי כן, שבעת ימים</span></span></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span>מבחן אמריקאי</span></span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span><span>מרבכת=חלוטה במים רותחים<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span><span>כליל=הכל<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span><span>אליה=זנב<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span><span>ויז=התיז<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span><span>רקיק=מאפה דק<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span><span>פגול=מאוס</span></span></span></p></div><div><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span>מדרגאות<br /></span></span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span>אך, מאך, מאכל,</span><span>&nbsp;מלאכה,</span><span>&nbsp;מלכה, למך, מך</span></span><p></p></div>"
